          "name": "interrupt_polarity",
          "access": "R/W",
          "desc": "每 bit 选择中断极性：`0` = active-low / falling-edge（default）；`1` = active-high / rising-edge。Reset: `32'b0`",
          "reserved": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
